DeCS — Descritores em Ciências da Saúde (@med-source-decs: 0, is #reference, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_32JDHQDTBG260AEJ12TP8WRY1G
BIREME/PAHO/WHO. DeCS, Descritores em Ciências da Saúde / Health Sciences Descriptors. Multilingual controlled vocabulary.

[Authorized source](https://decs.bvsalud.org/).

Compare English and Portuguese descriptors for a literature search, including shoulder, joint, tendon, muscle, pain, and relevant disorders. Preferred indexing terms and everyday or clinical usage can differ. The site provides edition information and citation guidance; it is not a clinical dictionary that diagnoses an individual.

**Access and reuse:** Freely readable on the author, publisher, or institution website. Copyright remains with the stated rights holder; no local copy or permission to adapt is supplied.

